!! Workspace Widget

The `workspace` widget is to list all threads of a workspace with Anything LLM.

!! Syntax

```
<$workspaces />
```

!! Content and attributes
|!Attributes |!Type |!Description |
|workspace |required|The `workspace` slug name in Anything LLM |


!! Example

<$macrocall $name="wikitext-example" 
src="""<$workspace workspace="test"/>"""/>